WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.562 --> 00:00:02.246
- He's a spiritual leader and the founder

00:00:02.246 --> 00:00:04.883
of the Art of Living Foundation.

00:00:04.883 --> 00:00:07.021
The Art of Living
Foundation aims to relieve

00:00:07.021 --> 00:00:10.616
individual stress, societal
problems, and violence.

00:00:10.616 --> 00:00:12.227
In 1997, he established the

00:00:12.227 --> 00:00:15.259
International Association
for Human Values.

00:00:15.259 --> 00:00:17.143
He's Sri Sri Ravi Shankar

00:00:17.143 --> 00:00:20.643
and here are his top 10 rules for success.

00:00:22.462 --> 00:00:25.852
- I'm one who always welcomes criticism.

00:00:25.852 --> 00:00:29.391
I encourage people you
should welcome criticism.

00:00:29.391 --> 00:00:32.760
And be bold enough to give criticism.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.944
If the criticism is
coming out of benevolence

00:00:35.944 --> 00:00:38.651
that someone is criticizing me

00:00:38.651 --> 00:00:40.984
so that I can become better,

00:00:42.505 --> 00:00:44.307
then it is always welcome.

00:00:44.307 --> 00:00:47.433
But if someone is criticizing
just out of jealousy

00:00:47.433 --> 00:00:49.623
or trying to pull someone down,

00:00:49.623 --> 00:00:52.192
then that is not good.

00:00:52.192 --> 00:00:55.775
Then that is coming
from a malefic mindset.

00:00:58.835 --> 00:01:03.676
So constructive criticism I
feel everyone should welcome.

00:01:03.676 --> 00:01:05.376
Criticism, compassion.

00:01:05.376 --> 00:01:08.876
Criticism with love is most adorable thing

00:01:10.388 --> 00:01:12.424
and it should always be welcomed.

00:01:12.424 --> 00:01:16.591
If you can embrace embarrassment,
nothing can shake you.

00:01:21.249 --> 00:01:23.124
It's one thing that people try

00:01:23.124 --> 00:01:25.957
to run away from is embarrassment.

00:01:28.478 --> 00:01:31.911
Criticism, a mild form of embarrassment

00:01:31.911 --> 00:01:35.035
is a mild form of criticism.

00:01:35.035 --> 00:01:38.118
A mild form of feeling uncomfortable.

00:01:39.424 --> 00:01:43.361
So sometime we need to get
out of the comfort zone,

00:01:43.361 --> 00:01:45.669
feel that little uncomfortable.

00:01:45.669 --> 00:01:49.169
Yes, then, you know, abilities in us dawn.

00:01:50.083 --> 00:01:52.250
If you are content, happy.

00:01:56.035 --> 00:01:57.618
If you're centered,

00:02:00.983 --> 00:02:03.316
everything will flow to you.

00:02:04.799 --> 00:02:07.444
You don't have to go and grab something.

00:02:07.444 --> 00:02:09.611
Things will come your way.

00:02:11.122 --> 00:02:13.122
This is what I'm saying.

00:02:13.968 --> 00:02:16.873
This is why this world is called, Maya.

00:02:16.873 --> 00:02:18.529
Do you know what Maya means?

00:02:18.529 --> 00:02:20.928
When you try to go and grab it,

00:02:20.928 --> 00:02:22.761
it runs away from you.

00:02:25.698 --> 00:02:27.323
What?

00:02:27.323 --> 00:02:28.843
If you try to possess,

00:02:28.843 --> 00:02:30.676
it you try to grab something,

00:02:30.676 --> 00:02:32.176
it just runs away.

00:02:34.203 --> 00:02:37.388
And if you are stable, still,

00:02:37.388 --> 00:02:40.080
content within yourself,

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:42.505
they all run towards you.

00:02:42.505 --> 00:02:44.903
You know I say we are all global people.

00:02:44.903 --> 00:02:48.799
We have to learn something
from every way in the world.

00:02:48.799 --> 00:02:51.795
And I would say we have
to learn the precision,

00:02:51.795 --> 00:02:55.891
and the timeliness, and the
commitment from Germans.

00:02:55.891 --> 00:02:57.562
The world should learn.

00:02:57.562 --> 00:03:00.810
I always say that perfection
is always Germans.

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:03.961
Etiquecies is always from England.

00:03:03.961 --> 00:03:07.348
The mannerisms, etiquecies, you know?

00:03:07.348 --> 00:03:11.515
And business and salesmanship,
Americans (laughs).

00:03:17.357 --> 00:03:19.738
Teamwork from Japanese.

00:03:19.738 --> 00:03:23.004
Japanese are so good in teamwork.

00:03:23.004 --> 00:03:25.865
Similarly spirituality from India.

00:03:25.865 --> 00:03:28.967
Human values, spirituality, compassion.

00:03:28.967 --> 00:03:30.980
It all comes from India.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:35.147
So we need to get the best
from every part of the world.

00:03:36.252 --> 00:03:39.047
In the next coming generation will see

00:03:39.047 --> 00:03:43.251
that sort of global human being, you know.

00:03:43.251 --> 00:03:47.195
Of course, technology has
shrunk the whole world

00:03:47.195 --> 00:03:49.052
into a global village.

00:03:49.052 --> 00:03:51.478
Today through technology, once again,

00:03:51.478 --> 00:03:54.491
we communicate with the whole world.

00:03:54.491 --> 00:03:57.908
In the same way, if we can tune our minds

00:03:59.855 --> 00:04:02.220
to the simplicities, the innocence.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:06.793
To caring and sharing we
will find the whole world

00:04:06.793 --> 00:04:08.323
as one family.

00:04:08.323 --> 00:04:09.777
Global family.

00:04:09.777 --> 00:04:11.181
When you want to have balance,

00:04:11.181 --> 00:04:12.605
you will definitely have it.

00:04:12.605 --> 00:04:13.938
You can have it.

00:04:17.026 --> 00:04:20.895
Just as "I want to have balance my life"

00:04:20.895 --> 00:04:22.996
this thought itself is good enough,

00:04:22.996 --> 00:04:25.021
you're already balancing.

00:04:25.021 --> 00:04:27.688
You are moving in the direction.

00:04:28.665 --> 00:04:29.579
Yeah.

00:04:29.579 --> 00:04:32.390
This question simply
arises "How do I do it?"

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:34.726
You know you can do it.

00:04:34.726 --> 00:04:37.947
Ask yourself, your
consciousness will tell you,

00:04:37.947 --> 00:04:39.485
"I'm not balanced.

00:04:39.485 --> 00:04:41.649
"I'm missing out on this."

00:04:41.649 --> 00:04:43.409
Your consciousness will say.

00:04:43.409 --> 00:04:47.184
Then you listen to your consciousness.

00:04:47.184 --> 00:04:49.238
If you're attending to your work too much,

00:04:49.238 --> 00:04:51.105
your consciousness will prick,

00:04:51.105 --> 00:04:53.567
"Hey you're forgetting your family,

00:04:53.567 --> 00:04:56.419
"your wife, your children, your husband."

00:04:56.419 --> 00:04:59.156
And then you'll say, "Okay,
I'll attend to them."

00:04:59.156 --> 00:05:02.419
If you're attending too
much, so much in the family,

00:05:02.419 --> 00:05:04.755
and forget about all other things,

00:05:04.755 --> 00:05:06.766
then your consciousness will prick,

00:05:06.766 --> 00:05:08.371
"My God, what am I got into?

00:05:08.371 --> 00:05:10.305
"What did I get into?

00:05:10.305 --> 00:05:14.472
"Day and night I'm just
emerged in this family affairs,

00:05:16.655 --> 00:05:19.572
"I'm not being useful to the world.

00:05:21.481 --> 00:05:22.734
"I have to do something.

00:05:22.734 --> 00:05:25.563
"I have to pursue my cause.

00:05:25.563 --> 00:05:28.003
"I have to do justice to my work."

00:05:28.003 --> 00:05:29.749
The mind will prick.

00:05:29.749 --> 00:05:31.416
Then you'll do that.

00:05:32.579 --> 00:05:35.193
But this wanting to keep balance in life,

00:05:35.193 --> 00:05:37.634
that very thought is good enough.

00:05:37.634 --> 00:05:41.301
It's like the fuse in
the electrical system.

00:05:43.304 --> 00:05:45.796
You know the fuse in
the electrical system?

00:05:45.796 --> 00:05:49.246
Whenever electric current surges too much,

00:05:49.246 --> 00:05:52.996
the fuse will break and
save everything else.

00:05:54.343 --> 00:05:58.565
Like that little amount
of guilt must be there.

00:05:58.565 --> 00:06:00.650
Like the fuse in the system.

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:04.650
You don't justify your
work, but that little bit

00:06:06.263 --> 00:06:09.860
is okay to have like the fuse in it.

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:12.827
You know the electrical system,

00:06:12.827 --> 00:06:14.715
and on the electrical board,

00:06:14.715 --> 00:06:17.882
there'll be one small box called fuse.

00:06:19.971 --> 00:06:22.041
So whenever there is imbalance in current

00:06:22.041 --> 00:06:25.239
the fuse will burst and save the rest

00:06:25.239 --> 00:06:27.825
of the electrical system.

00:06:27.825 --> 00:06:31.947
Like that in life, a little
bit of guilt is okay.

00:06:31.947 --> 00:06:33.364
But not too much.

00:06:34.283 --> 00:06:35.827
Like salt in the food.

00:06:35.827 --> 00:06:38.148
If there is too much salt, can you eat it?

00:06:38.148 --> 00:06:38.981
No.

00:06:40.604 --> 00:06:41.919
Got it?

00:06:41.919 --> 00:06:45.772
So wanting to have
balance is good to have.

00:06:45.772 --> 00:06:47.792
Like breathing in and breathing out

00:06:47.792 --> 00:06:50.943
we need passion, we need dispassion,

00:06:50.943 --> 00:06:52.368
and we need compassion.

00:06:52.368 --> 00:06:54.285
All three has to exist.

00:06:55.584 --> 00:06:57.179
People without passion

00:06:57.179 --> 00:06:59.617
cannot achieve anything in their life.

00:06:59.617 --> 00:07:00.839
So you need passion.

00:07:00.839 --> 00:07:03.435
Especially youngsters,

00:07:03.435 --> 00:07:04.732
they need to have a passion.

00:07:04.732 --> 00:07:08.071
They lack passion, they
get into depression.

00:07:08.071 --> 00:07:09.947
So passion is essential.

00:07:09.947 --> 00:07:13.575
But only passion, this
has been the problem.

00:07:13.575 --> 00:07:17.742
Only passion will lead to
disappointment and despair.

00:07:18.704 --> 00:07:20.743
So you need to have little detachment,

00:07:20.743 --> 00:07:22.326
that is dispassion.

00:07:24.352 --> 00:07:27.102
And dispassion is when it's like,

00:07:28.891 --> 00:07:30.591
okay you did a lot of activity

00:07:30.591 --> 00:07:33.899
and you take some time to sleep, rest.

00:07:33.899 --> 00:07:36.307
You let everything go and relax.

00:07:36.307 --> 00:07:38.935
You switch over to this side,

00:07:38.935 --> 00:07:41.352
and meditation is part of it.

00:07:42.351 --> 00:07:45.643
The ability to let go and move forward,

00:07:45.643 --> 00:07:48.191
that I would call as dispassion.

00:07:48.191 --> 00:07:50.587
And in between we need compassion.

00:07:50.587 --> 00:07:53.358
If you see you have a wrong decision,

00:07:53.358 --> 00:07:56.370
you have to weigh the pros and cons.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:59.087
"Should I continue on this all my life?

00:07:59.087 --> 00:08:00.529
"Or should I change?

00:08:00.529 --> 00:08:04.446
"If I change what is the
loss that I will face?

00:08:05.632 --> 00:08:09.059
"What is the problems I may encounter?"

00:08:09.059 --> 00:08:10.809
You have to weigh it.

00:08:11.687 --> 00:08:14.979
You have to see how much the
change will make you better

00:08:14.979 --> 00:08:18.118
or if the change even more problematic,

00:08:18.118 --> 00:08:19.618
better not change.

00:08:20.746 --> 00:08:25.600
Just carry on with whatever
wrong decision you made.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:26.433
You know.

00:08:28.395 --> 00:08:30.360
Sometimes you can't change.

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:31.875
You have made a wrong decision,

00:08:31.875 --> 00:08:33.125
you have to go.

00:08:34.423 --> 00:08:35.256
You know.

00:08:36.295 --> 00:08:38.195
You can't think of being a bachelor,

00:08:38.195 --> 00:08:41.242
after you have had a kid (laughs).

00:08:41.242 --> 00:08:42.530
Once you have a child,

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:46.077
then you have to be a father
or mother and continue.

00:08:46.077 --> 00:08:49.463
There's no point in regretting the past.

00:08:49.463 --> 00:08:51.859
Similarly you wanted to be a doctor,

00:08:51.859 --> 00:08:54.109
but you became an engineer.

00:08:55.416 --> 00:08:58.227
And after 25 years of
serving as an engineer,

00:08:58.227 --> 00:09:00.854
you can't say, "No I made a wrong choice.

00:09:00.854 --> 00:09:04.270
"I should've been a doctor." (laughs)

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.112
There's no point.

00:09:05.112 --> 00:09:07.983
Now you can't go back to study the school

00:09:07.983 --> 00:09:10.514
and become a doctor, again.

00:09:10.514 --> 00:09:14.135
You are an engineer,
continue on with that.

00:09:14.135 --> 00:09:15.728
Got it?

00:09:15.728 --> 00:09:18.712
So you have to weigh the pros and cons.

00:09:18.712 --> 00:09:20.332
You see to achieve anything in the world

00:09:20.332 --> 00:09:21.665
it needs effort.

00:09:25.431 --> 00:09:27.146
To achieve anything in the world,

00:09:27.146 --> 00:09:30.063
any pleasure on any material thing,

00:09:31.914 --> 00:09:33.520
you want to achieve,

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:34.853
it needs effort.

00:09:37.462 --> 00:09:39.166
If you look at the benefits

00:09:39.166 --> 00:09:42.295
that meditation bring into our life,

00:09:42.295 --> 00:09:44.322
you feel it is all the more relevant,

00:09:44.322 --> 00:09:45.989
all the more needed.

00:09:49.198 --> 00:09:54.042
In ancient times meditation
was used for enlightenment.

00:09:54.042 --> 00:09:55.792
For finding the self.

00:10:02.675 --> 00:10:06.425
And meditation is a way
to get rid of misery,

00:10:10.761 --> 00:10:14.554
to overcome misery, overcome problems.

00:10:14.554 --> 00:10:17.026
Meditation has been the way

00:10:17.026 --> 00:10:19.276
to improve one's abilities.

00:10:21.498 --> 00:10:23.166
Three things.

00:10:23.166 --> 00:10:27.333
And today living apart,
living aside enlightenment,

00:10:29.194 --> 00:10:32.597
if you see the social ills of today,

00:10:32.597 --> 00:10:34.514
the stress and tension,

00:10:36.262 --> 00:10:38.679
it calls for one to meditate.

00:10:39.519 --> 00:10:43.753
The more responsibility
you have in your life,

00:10:43.753 --> 00:10:46.582
more is the need for meditation.

00:10:46.582 --> 00:10:50.332
Life is much larger than
failure and success.

00:10:52.162 --> 00:10:55.579
Life is much larger than birth and death.

00:10:58.516 --> 00:11:00.849
We are much beyond them all.

00:11:03.846 --> 00:11:05.364
Got it?

00:11:05.364 --> 00:11:07.958
If you have the strength,

00:11:07.958 --> 00:11:10.525
if you can understand this knowledge,

00:11:10.525 --> 00:11:13.197
then you will walk like a king.

00:11:13.197 --> 00:11:14.947
Nobody can shake you.

00:11:16.121 --> 00:11:17.238
- Thank you so much for watching.

00:11:17.238 --> 00:11:20.616
I made this video because
Shagun Rawat asked me to.

00:11:20.616 --> 00:11:22.134
So if there's a famous entrepreneur

00:11:22.134 --> 00:11:23.524
that you want me to profile next,

00:11:23.524 --> 00:11:25.163
leave it in the comments below

00:11:25.163 --> 00:11:26.552
and I'll see what I can do.

00:11:26.552 --> 00:11:28.592
I also love to know
which of the top 10 rules

00:11:28.592 --> 00:11:30.757
had the biggest impact on you.

00:11:30.757 --> 00:11:31.857
Leave it in the comments

00:11:31.857 --> 00:11:33.401
and I will join the discussion.

00:11:33.401 --> 00:11:34.576
Thank you so much for watching.

00:11:34.576 --> 00:11:35.953
Continue to believe

00:11:35.953 --> 00:11:37.786
and I'll see you soon.

